      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic, highly skilled veterinary doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents speak warmly of the medical team, specifically highlighting Dr. McAdoo, Dr. O'Malley, Dr. Hartis, and Dr. Tacam. Reviewers appreciate the staff's gentle bedside manner, attentive care, and readiness to help during both routine and critical moments. Aside from an isolated complaint about front desk responsiveness, the clinic is praised for its compassion."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach for anxious companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of fearful dogs and sensitive cats commend the clinic for accommodating anxious pets with calm patience and low-stress handling. Reviewers report that veterinarians spend extra time soothing nervous rescues, Huskies, and Dalmatians before proceeding with physical exams. Clients note that even pets with prior veterinary trauma feel supported."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and transparent treatment plans"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently mention that veterinarians take unhurried time to answer questions, outline diagnosis options, and explain medical issues in detail. Reviewers appreciate receiving prompt updates during surgical procedures and thorough guidance for chronic conditions. Pet owners feel fully involved in decisions regarding their pets' well-being."
      }
    }
  ],
